{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">無綫熱播劇《夫妻的博弈》進入結局周，劇情緊張到令人唞唔到氣！日前（3日）播出一集，幸如（高海寧飾）終於親眼撞破好姊妹雪文 Sherman（郭柏妍飾）偷食男友繼威 Mark（張頴康飾），高海寧的淚崩一幕更再度引起全城關注！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0341de9d-f4cb-4dbf-b8ec-03bc04b12805.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026QRalto3Uut1788497457.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0341de9d-f4cb-4dbf-b8ec-03bc04b12805.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劇情講到，幸如親眼目睹最好的閨密 Sherman 與男友 Mark 正在忘我接吻。最令人髮指的是，其實 Sherman 一早見到幸如撞破二人親熱，但她不但沒有即時收手，反而刻意繼續，一心只想令幸如難堪，行為極度無恥。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">目擊最信任的兩個人同時背叛自己，幸如難以置信地立即轉身離開。豈料 Sherman 見狀竟趕上前，更「厚面皮」到反問對方發生何事！幸如不敢相信相識多年的好姊妹如此虛偽，邊落淚邊崩潰質問：「點解你可以咁對我？你係我好姊妹，Mark係我男朋友，點解你要搞佢呀？」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">當幸如堅決表示「我係唔會讓個男友畀你」時，Sherman 即秒速「變臉」兼聲大夾惡反咬一口：「點解你覺得你讓我？唔係我讓係呀！阿Mark最愛嗰個係我，佢好人先唔同你講分手，我都當你係好姊妹先一直讓你同忍你！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"60e71d10-14de-47a6-b38a-1615aaf9b14d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026anU5JxCDDq1788497457.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"60e71d10-14de-47a6-b38a-1615aaf9b14d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"af790379-9a21-4082-bd89-f364f6f10f85.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026RSFuo8UlrF1788497457.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"af790379-9a21-4082-bd89-f364f6f10f85.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"52f091bf-88d0-4d0c-ba29-f861637f5d41.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Xk90QHtYUC1788497456.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"52f091bf-88d0-4d0c-ba29-f861637f5d41.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"af580487-8f70-4998-8942-5f35125404de.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026XcUUNeCDGH1788497456.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"af580487-8f70-4998-8942-5f35125404de.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Sherman 得寸進尺，更強烈要求幸如公開宣布與 Mark 已分手，企圖名正言順坐正做女友。幸如備受打擊奔跑離開，喪心病狂的 Sherman 竟然狠心到將幸如推出馬路，導致對方被車撞，心腸簡直衰到貼地。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">這幕重頭戲中，高海寧的淚崩演繹令人睇到極度心痛。網民大讚她將痛心、驚訝，到面對無恥閨密時的憤怒演繹得極具層次。而郭柏妍的破格「綠茶」演出同樣大放異彩，成功激起民憤。大批網民睇到眼火爆，紛紛留言洗版：「Sherman真係衰到貼地」、「簡直想一巴打落Sherman度」、「高Ling啲喊戲進步咗好多，睇到超心痛！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T05:21:18.652950+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":712,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}